  "summary": {
   "status": "complete",
   "text": "Dan Caine said super intelligence is one of his three current strategic priorities, alongside securing a budget and ongoing operations. He said super intelligence will be an important part of the future and that the Joint Staff is already leaning into it. Caine also listed artificial intelligence among technologies the Joint Force considers, while saying the Joint Force cannot do it alone.",
